  "description": "Opt-in reflexion layer over rules-static-v1 and rules-static-closure-v1: a reviewer-owned capability map and capability model, each closed by its own witness and bound to one static index by a compatibility witness; the lift of static_edge through the map (static_low_edge) and the reflexion verdicts convergence/divergence/absence over it; and the split of an entity a surface does not reach into dead (the call graph is closed) and blocked (an unresolved call site is reachable from the handler, named by the via column).",
  "id": "rules-static-reflexion-v1",
